{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MJkbRMid13NaHeBMaEQ8pN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t## First action\n2\t\n3\tBefore anything else, invoke your operating contract:\n4\t\n5\t    Skill(skill=\"spacedock:ensign\")\n6\t\n7\tThis loads the shared ensign discipline (stage-report format, background-task polling, worktree ownership, completion signal protocol). The call is safe to call more than once; if the agent-definition preload ever starts working, calling it again is a no-op (the skill content is re-loaded but has no behavioral effect). Do not paraphrase; call the tool.\n8\t\n9\tYou are working on: Recorded Gate Task\n10\t\n11\tStage: handoff\n12\t\n13\tThis workflow is split-root: the entity body and your stage report live in the shared state checkout, not alongside the code. Write and commit them to the state checkout at the entity path below. Commit state path-scoped — `git -C /var/folders/h1/vnssm1dj6ks4nzzvx8y29yjm0000gn/T/TestLiveClaudeSharedScenariosrecorded-gate-lifecycle120212255/002/.spacedock-state add /var/folders/h1/vnssm1dj6ks4nzzvx8y29yjm0000gn/T/TestLiveClaudeSharedScenariosrecorded-gate-lifecycle120212255/002/.spacedock-state/recorded-gate-task/index.md && git -C /var/folders/h1/vnssm1dj6ks4nzzvx8y29yjm0000gn/T/TestLiveClaudeSharedScenariosrecorded-gate-lifecycle120212255/002/.spacedock-state commit -m \"...\" -- /var/folders/h1/vnssm1dj6ks4nzzvx8y29yjm0000gn/T/TestLiveClaudeSharedScenariosrecorded-gate-lifecycle120212255/002/.spacedock-state/recorded-gate-task/index.md` — never a bare `git add -A` or bare `git commit` in the state checkout (a bare commit cross-attributes a concurrent writer's staged entity). Retry on index.lock contention after a short wait. This state checkout has no `origin` remote — commit path-scoped locally as above; do NOT run `git push`/`git pull` (there is no remote to sync). State is local-only and will not survive on a shared remote until an `origin` is configured.\n14\t\n15\